#: ../../source/peripherals/pm.md:10
msgid ""
"The PM (Power Management) driver provides an interface for controlling "
"microcontroller power states. It supports the system entering various "
"low-power modes to save energy, and defines system wakeup mechanisms. The"
" driver also manages retention memory and sleep duration validation."
msgstr ""

